  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovery of Agricultural Livelihoods and Food Security for Vulnerable Communities in Eastern Cuba after Hurricane Melissa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protect and restore agricultural livelihoods through the rapid reactivation of short cycle vegetable production, in order to improve the food and nutrition security of households affected by Hurricane Melissa in the prioritized municipalities of Granma and Santiago de Cuba.</narrative>
  </description>
